{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212490","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121249001:0":{"text":"놀래라... 다들 여기 있었군요. 전 알파 일레븐이 또 도망간 줄 알았어요!","source_cn":"吓我一跳……原来你们跑来这里了，我还以为阿尔法十一又逃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7B1C63872C9996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121249001":{"text":"놀래라... 다들 여기 있었군요. 전 알파 일레븐이 또 도망간 줄 알았어요!","source_cn":"吓我一跳……原来你们跑来这里了，我还以为阿尔法十一又逃走了呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7B1C63872C9996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121249002:0":{"text":"알겠어요... 다미안은 아직도 화가 나 있어요. 새는 잘 묻어줬다고 제가 나중에 전해줄게요.","source_cn":"好吧……达米安还在生气呢，我之后会告诉他，小鸟已经被安葬了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE79A0737CD7C976F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121249003:0":{"text":"흙 속에 묻어두면 이블플라워처럼 흙 속에서 다시 태어나는 거야?","source_cn":"只要把它们埋进土里，它们也能像魔花一样，再从土里生长出来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F82C603861FFC10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121249004:0":{"text":"무슨 생각을 하는 거야... 그건 불가능해.","source_cn":"想什么呢……不可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09703C2911D95533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121249005:0":{"text":"그럼 땅에 묻는 의미가 없잖아?","source_cn":"这样做的意义呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9DA1EFA0B9866B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121249006:0":{"text":"우리의 생명은 자연으로부터 온 것이니, 죽은 뒤에도 자연으로 돌아가야 마땅하지.","source_cn":"我们的生命源于自然，死后，也应当回归自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FB9434B30BA5B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121249007:0":{"text":"사실 죽은 자에게 돌아갈 곳이 있다는 건 남겨진 사람들에게 큰 위로가 돼. 어쩌면 이게 바로 그 의미이지 않을까?","source_cn":"但是死者有了归处，其实是生者获得慰藉。或许这就是意义吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0499C7114C6BF858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121249008:0":{"text":"아직도 이해하기 힘들어...","source_cn":"我还是听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0025BB8F3D8BBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121249009:0":{"text":"네 신분을 알게 되면 분명 이해할 수 있을 거야. 지금은 그것보다 다프니 할머니께서 좀 보자고 하셨어.","source_cn":"等你知道自己的身份后，一定可以理解。现在先别想这些了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A43416679D8CB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121249010:0":{"text":"네가 약을 먹고 난 뒤에 상태가 어떤지 궁금하신 거 같아. 얼른 가보자.","source_cn":"她想知道你吃了药以后情况如何，快过去找她吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E52FE9EC51040F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"(레미아에게 설명한다)","source_cn":"（向蕾米雅说明）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3774EE230F2698B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(레미아에게 설명한다)","female":"(레미아에게 설명한다)","variant_male_record_index":"63290","variant_female_record_index":"63291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"알파 일레븐","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}